==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
*From {{proto|Uralic|kola-|lang=fi}}. Cognate with Hungarian {{term|hal|lang=hu}}.

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: kuol·la
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:Finnish:-uolːɑ|-uolːɑ]]
*{{IPA|lang=fi|/'kuolːɑ(ʔ)/}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb|kuol|type=tulla}}

# {{intransitive|+ illative}} To [[die]] of/from.
#:''[[isoäiti|Isoäiti]][[-ni|ni]] '''kuoli''' [[syöpä|syöpään]].''
#::''My grandmother '''died''' of cancer.''
# {{fi-form of|type=verb|pr=impersonal|mood=indicative|tense=present connegative|[[kuolla]]}}

